WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:58.959
=Episode 4=
=The Tang Clan Upheaval: Part Two=

01:58.960 --> 02:02.119
(Tang Family Fort)

02:02.120 --> 02:04.779
(A harmonious family prospers
in all things)

02:04.880 --> 02:06.039
Zhiyun,

02:06.040 --> 02:07.160
tell me,

02:07.480 --> 02:09.360
what did you read?

02:09.400 --> 02:10.640
Third Uncle,

02:10.680 --> 02:14.439
Tang Xuejian is the wild child
the old clan master picked up.

02:14.440 --> 02:15.279
You're lying!

02:15.280 --> 02:16.919
Everyone here can testify.

02:16.920 --> 02:17.959
This booklet

02:17.960 --> 02:19.719
was taken out by Tang Xuejian herself

02:19.720 --> 02:23.360
from the Ziwu Xuanji Box
left by the old clan master.

02:23.680 --> 02:25.880
This is the old clan master's diary.

02:26.680 --> 02:28.160
My grandpa's diary?

02:29.060 --> 02:30.640
The 23rd day of the twelfth lunar month.

02:30.720 --> 02:32.279
Heavy snow covered the sky,

02:32.280 --> 02:34.080
a sight rare in decades.

02:34.340 --> 02:36.400
(Spirit tablets of my late son)
Even Heaven mourned the deaths

02:36.400 --> 02:38.080
(Tang Feng and his wife, Madam Liu)
of Feng and his wife.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.599
Just then, Jing Yi arrived,

02:39.600 --> 02:41.920
(Tang Xuejian's grandfather)
bringing an abandoned baby girl.

02:41.920 --> 02:42.840
Kun.

02:46.680 --> 02:48.160
This child is...

02:48.160 --> 02:49.559
(Jing Tian's mother)
She was found in front of Yong'an Pawnshop

02:49.560 --> 02:51.080
(Jing Tian's father, Jing Yi)
the night before last,

02:51.120 --> 02:53.000
during the heavy snowfall.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.680
That

02:55.120 --> 02:58.560
was the very night
Feng and his wife passed away.

02:59.760 --> 03:00.880
Yes.

03:01.440 --> 03:03.880
We truly had no means to raise her,

03:04.240 --> 03:06.960
so we hoped to find a family
to adopt her.

03:07.120 --> 03:08.439
She was named Xuejian,

03:08.440 --> 03:10.199
to be regarded as Feng's descendant,

03:10.200 --> 03:11.749
to console our grief.

03:11.750 --> 03:14.440
(So it turns out father picked up
Xuejian back then,)

03:14.540 --> 03:16.320
(and handed her to the old clan master.)

03:16.920 --> 03:17.999
Nonsense!

03:18.000 --> 03:19.319
It's all fake!

03:19.320 --> 03:20.079
I don't believe it!

03:20.080 --> 03:21.160
Don't believe it?

03:21.480 --> 03:23.079
Then see for yourself.

03:23.080 --> 03:25.440
You recognize the clan master's
handwriting, don't you?

03:26.800 --> 03:28.039
No wonder.

03:28.040 --> 03:30.759
She never looked like
a true Tang Clan young lady.

03:30.760 --> 03:33.320
An adopted abandoned child daring
to vie for the clan master position.

03:33.440 --> 03:34.319
How shameless!

03:34.320 --> 03:35.119
Shameless!

03:35.120 --> 03:35.919
Hurry up and leave!

03:35.920 --> 03:37.720
Stop disgracing yourself!
Go! Go! Go!

03:37.840 --> 03:39.340
Who cares to be part
of Tang Clan anyway?

03:39.340 --> 03:41.599
Let us see the clan master.
We'll leave immediately after.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.559
The position of clan master
has not yet been decided.

03:43.560 --> 03:44.759
Why are you making such a fuss?

03:44.760 --> 03:47.520
Since Tang Xuejian
is not of the Tang Clan,

03:47.600 --> 03:50.080
then the clan master position
should fall to me.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.360
Tang Yi.

03:51.440 --> 03:54.119
You dare not release the Five Poison
Immortal Beast to prove yourself,

03:54.120 --> 03:55.680
so it doesn't count.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.919
Third Uncle is virtuous
and highly respected,

03:57.920 --> 03:59.799
devoting himself wholeheartedly
to the Tang Clan,

03:59.800 --> 04:01.159
toiling his entire life.

04:01.160 --> 04:04.120
The clan master position can belong
to no one else but Third Uncle.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.920
We respectfully invite the clan master
to take the seat.

04:05.920 --> 04:08.460
- We respectfully invite the clan master!
- We respectfully invite the clan master!

04:10.220 --> 04:11.180
This...

04:13.440 --> 04:15.360
Since it is the will of the people,

04:15.440 --> 04:18.760
then I shall not shirk
this responsibility.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.240
Sit.

04:25.280 --> 04:27.280
You old fox!

04:27.480 --> 04:29.919
You had this all planned from the start.

04:29.920 --> 04:31.839
Letting us fight among ourselves,

04:31.840 --> 04:33.399
while you reap the benefits.

04:33.400 --> 04:34.520
Tch!

04:34.560 --> 04:36.280
Don't even dream of it!

04:37.520 --> 04:39.273
Tang Yi used dark arts

04:39.274 --> 04:41.959
to control the Tang Clan's treasured
Five Poison Immortal Beast,

04:41.960 --> 04:43.680
and colluded with outsiders.

04:43.680 --> 04:45.900
You are ordered to immediately
hand over the immortal beast

04:45.900 --> 04:47.400
and submit to clan punishment.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.320
Third Uncle.

04:58.420 --> 05:02.120
How does my Poison Dragon Powder taste?

05:04.000 --> 05:07.720
Colorless and tasteless,
impossible to guard against.

05:08.600 --> 05:10.919
Not inferior to the Tang Clan's
famed poison,

05:10.920 --> 05:12.999
Heavenly Maiden Scattering Flowers, is it?

05:13.000 --> 05:14.120
You...

05:14.840 --> 05:16.320
When did you...

05:16.920 --> 05:18.040
Hmph.

05:18.600 --> 05:21.160
When you made me clean the Baidu Hall,

05:21.800 --> 05:23.960
did you ever imagine this day would come?

05:25.040 --> 05:25.839
You...

05:25.840 --> 05:27.240
This is what you call

05:27.870 --> 05:29.400
reaping what you sow.

05:29.840 --> 05:31.400
You vile beast!

05:31.720 --> 05:33.840
You planned this long ago

05:33.880 --> 05:35.880
to murder your own kin!

05:37.480 --> 05:38.720
Kin?

05:39.120 --> 05:41.720
When did you ever treat me as family?

05:41.920 --> 05:44.880
My talent far surpassed
the other disciples,

05:45.080 --> 05:48.880
yet because of birth status,
I was oppressed by you all.

05:49.480 --> 05:50.800
Look at things now.

05:51.320 --> 05:54.400
The entire Tang Clan
is in the palm of my hand.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.720
(Hua Ying.)

05:57.960 --> 05:59.200
(Hua Ying.)

05:59.320 --> 06:00.720
(Come to me!)

06:04.760 --> 06:06.000
Come back here!

06:25.400 --> 06:28.199
Tang Yi. Your skills aren't all that impressive.

06:28.200 --> 06:29.520
Enough talk!

06:58.040 --> 06:58.680
That was close.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.479
My eyes...

06:59.480 --> 07:01.159
Luckily Hua Ying blocked it for me.

07:01.160 --> 07:03.360
What a vicious Tang Yi.

07:03.560 --> 07:05.071
Using Heartbreak Grass

07:05.072 --> 07:07.360
mixed with Golden Silkworm Gu
to make poison.

07:07.760 --> 07:12.160
When these two deadly poisons
are combined, there is no cure.

07:16.240 --> 07:18.520
You all fight to the death,

07:18.560 --> 07:20.679
isn't it all just to become clan master?

07:20.680 --> 07:22.719
Let me save you the trouble.

07:22.720 --> 07:23.920
Who is this?

07:23.960 --> 07:25.759
He is the hall master of Thunder Hall,

07:25.760 --> 07:26.839
Luo Rulie.

07:26.840 --> 07:28.000
Luo Rulie!

07:28.240 --> 07:30.480
Tang Family Fort is heavily guarded,

07:30.520 --> 07:32.200
how did you get in?

07:33.020 --> 07:34.720
What do you think?

07:36.240 --> 07:39.760
The entire Tang Family Fort
has been taken over by Thunder Hall.

07:40.080 --> 07:41.759
From today onward,

07:41.760 --> 07:45.240
there will be no Tang Clan
left in the martial world.

07:46.040 --> 07:47.280
Hall Master Luo.

07:47.480 --> 07:48.600
The elixir.

07:49.080 --> 07:50.200
Save me!

07:51.200 --> 07:52.320
Tang Yi.

07:53.200 --> 07:56.200
I never believed you
could become clan master.

07:56.760 --> 07:58.799
I merely wanted you
to stir up chaos here,

07:58.800 --> 08:01.120
so the Tang Clan would be
caught unprepared.

08:01.560 --> 08:04.720
That way, I could easily
take over the fortress.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.280
Now,

08:08.040 --> 08:10.800
you no longer have any value.

08:13.280 --> 08:16.800
So there's no need to waste
this elixir on you.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.280
Bring him in.

08:26.800 --> 08:27.879
Grandpa.

08:27.880 --> 08:28.679
Tang Xuejian.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.199
Xuejian.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.599
Hand over the Five Poison Pearl.

08:30.600 --> 08:31.660
Otherwise,

08:31.800 --> 08:33.719
I'll kill your grandfather.

08:33.720 --> 08:34.840
Stop!

08:34.920 --> 08:35.760
Freeze!

08:39.520 --> 08:40.639
Grandpa.

08:40.640 --> 08:42.000
Are you alright?

08:42.560 --> 08:43.720
Xuejian.

08:44.360 --> 08:46.800
Seeing that you're safe,

08:47.400 --> 08:49.519
I can finally rest easy.

08:49.520 --> 08:51.079
You're a disciple of Shu Mountain?

08:51.080 --> 08:52.040
Oh?

08:52.160 --> 08:53.599
You've got a good eye.

08:53.600 --> 08:55.880
Even dressed like this,
you still recognized me.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.240
(I have a bad feeling about this.)

09:08.950 --> 09:10.950
Why is Thunder Hall full of monsters?

09:32.760 --> 09:33.760
Jing Tian!

09:44.520 --> 09:45.640
Die!

09:46.200 --> 09:47.600
Let go of Xuejian!

09:51.720 --> 09:52.840
Xuejian!

09:54.120 --> 09:55.520
Immortal beast,

09:55.680 --> 09:57.520
help me!

10:01.880 --> 10:03.120
The Five Poison Pearl!

10:03.200 --> 10:04.279
Stop!

10:04.280 --> 10:05.880
That's mine!

10:18.560 --> 10:19.840
Grandpa.

10:34.240 --> 10:35.240
Grandpa.

10:41.000 --> 10:42.560
Good child.

10:43.160 --> 10:44.560
Don't cry.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.200
I won't.

10:48.400 --> 10:49.800
All these years,

10:50.400 --> 10:52.520
I have been plagued
by illness and injuries,

10:52.760 --> 10:54.800
my strength and spirit failing.

10:55.520 --> 10:58.280
I failed to manage
Tang Family Fort properly,

10:58.940 --> 11:04.480
and that is why things came to this.

11:05.120 --> 11:07.000
Xuejian.

11:08.440 --> 11:12.560
Now you are my only concern
in this world.

11:12.920 --> 11:17.760
Leave this place and live your own life.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.640
The Tang Clan

11:20.080 --> 11:23.320
is beyond saving.

11:24.960 --> 11:29.000
I only have Grandpa left now.

11:30.600 --> 11:33.799
Clan Master Tang,
your Yixing teapot lid.

11:33.800 --> 11:35.360
This technique...

11:35.730 --> 11:37.279
Jing Yi.

11:37.280 --> 11:40.880
Jing Yi was my father.

11:42.040 --> 11:44.640
You are Jing Yi's child?

11:45.960 --> 11:48.440
What a twist of fate.

11:48.510 --> 11:49.960
Eighteen years ago,

11:50.170 --> 11:53.600
it was my father
who entrusted Xuejian to you.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.480
I suppose

11:55.600 --> 11:57.200
this is destiny.

11:57.720 --> 11:59.000
Rest assured.

11:59.400 --> 12:01.360
I will take good care of Xuejian.

12:02.800 --> 12:04.160
What are you saying?

12:04.680 --> 12:06.000
I'm the one looking out for you.

12:06.040 --> 12:08.800
You're both good children.

12:09.400 --> 12:11.640
I am very happy.

12:12.550 --> 12:14.600
Very happy.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.120
Grandpa!

12:19.800 --> 12:20.920
Grandpa!

12:21.350 --> 12:22.760
Grandpa!

12:26.490 --> 12:27.760
Xuejian.

12:28.070 --> 12:33.599
I treated you fairly all these years.
You can't just stand by and let me die.

12:33.600 --> 12:34.479
Xuejian.

12:34.480 --> 12:36.640
You'll always be our young lady!

12:37.080 --> 12:37.999
Xuejian.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.279
When you were six,

12:39.280 --> 12:41.159
I even bought you candied hawthorns.

12:41.160 --> 12:42.279
You remember, right?

12:42.280 --> 12:43.879
I've always doted on you.

12:43.880 --> 12:45.879
It's all Tang Tai's fault,

12:45.880 --> 12:47.599
insisting you were an outsider.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.800
Tch!

12:49.480 --> 12:50.600
Hua Ying.

12:51.760 --> 12:53.520
Are you willing to save them?

12:57.960 --> 12:58.960
It's undone.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.120
It's undone!

13:02.640 --> 13:05.720
- Thank you, immortal beast!
- Thank you, Young Lady!

13:06.160 --> 13:08.239
Thank you!

13:08.240 --> 13:08.999
Wait.

13:09.000 --> 13:10.360
Where is my poison mastery?

13:11.080 --> 13:12.680
My poison mastery is gone!

13:16.760 --> 13:18.160
Hua Ying said

13:18.710 --> 13:21.440
she couldn't tell which poisons
were in you,

13:21.500 --> 13:23.360
and which poisons you cultivated.

13:23.560 --> 13:26.720
To save your lives,
she had to neutralize them all.

13:27.920 --> 13:31.720
A lifetime of poison mastery is gone.

13:32.000 --> 13:34.440
What's the difference
between that and death?

13:36.200 --> 13:37.640
From this day on,

13:38.120 --> 13:39.960
I am no longer a member
of the Tang Clan.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.600
Hua Ying,

13:42.920 --> 13:44.360
you're free now too.

13:44.840 --> 13:46.640
No longer bound by the Tang Clan.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.480
Go wherever you wish.

13:54.520 --> 13:55.640
Jing Tian.

13:57.360 --> 13:59.520
I'll first take care
of my grandpa's funeral.

14:00.240 --> 14:02.240
Go wait for me
in the Southwest Bamboo Grove.

14:02.480 --> 14:04.320
I'll come find you when I'm done.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.159
Alright.

14:08.160 --> 14:10.519
(Assembly Hall)

14:10.520 --> 14:13.600
(Outside the city,
Southwest Bamboo Grove)

14:17.020 --> 14:17.879
Xuejian.

14:17.880 --> 14:18.870
You're here.

14:24.840 --> 14:25.960
Jing Tian.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.720
I...

14:29.760 --> 14:32.240
I can't let you be
the Yong'an Pawnshop manager anymore.

14:33.400 --> 14:34.800
That's okay.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.879
When I save up enough money,

14:36.880 --> 14:39.000
I'll just open another pawnshop.

14:39.900 --> 14:41.470
You don't have to be my lackey anymore.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.640
You should go.

14:45.480 --> 14:46.600
Then,

14:47.960 --> 14:49.240
where are you going?

14:50.200 --> 14:53.199
I'm going to Thunder Hall's
main headquarters to find Luo Rulie.

14:53.200 --> 14:53.959
But

14:53.960 --> 14:55.399
you can't beat him.

14:55.400 --> 14:56.600
Even if I can't,

14:57.240 --> 14:58.829
I can't just let him off.

14:58.830 --> 15:00.840
Then I'll go with you.

15:01.120 --> 15:02.599
If we can't win,

15:02.600 --> 15:03.920
we can always run.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.120
You've already helped me so much.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.919
I can't drag you into danger again.

15:10.920 --> 15:12.659
What are you saying?

15:12.660 --> 15:15.759
I'm half a hero now, you know.

15:15.760 --> 15:17.000
Besides,

15:17.040 --> 15:18.999
I promised the old clan master
I'd look after you.

15:19.000 --> 15:20.840
How could I let you face danger alone?

15:21.840 --> 15:23.840
Two people are always better than one.

15:28.400 --> 15:29.520
Hua Ying, you...

15:38.640 --> 15:39.760
Alright.

15:39.790 --> 15:41.920
Then make it three.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.639
Okay.

15:43.640 --> 15:44.760
Let's go.

15:53.740 --> 15:54.799
It's going to rain.

15:54.800 --> 15:56.470
Let's take shelter here for a bit.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.230
I'll go tidy up first.

16:09.400 --> 16:12.160
Xuejian, you sleep over there
with Hua Ying.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.360
I'll sleep over here.

16:18.680 --> 16:20.679
Then you're not allowed
to peek at night,

16:20.680 --> 16:21.879
no snoring,

16:21.880 --> 16:23.319
and no talking in your sleep either.

16:23.320 --> 16:24.359
In short,

16:24.360 --> 16:25.920
don't disturb my sleep.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.240
Alright.

17:18.440 --> 17:20.560
I finally found you.

17:21.840 --> 17:22.960
Yang.

17:23.040 --> 17:24.039
A ghost!

17:24.040 --> 17:26.960
A ghost!

17:30.240 --> 17:31.039
A ghost!

17:31.040 --> 17:33.040
It's me, Kui.

17:41.320 --> 17:42.159
(Long Yang, Long Kui)

17:42.160 --> 17:43.280
Yang.

17:43.720 --> 17:45.439
Jiang Kingdom is gone.

17:45.440 --> 17:47.960
Father and Mother are both dead.

17:48.400 --> 17:50.199
I only have you left.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.280
Kui.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.880
Jiang Kingdom will not perish.

17:58.080 --> 17:59.560
It won't.

18:01.680 --> 18:02.319
Kui!

18:02.320 --> 18:03.360
Run, now!

18:13.390 --> 18:14.450
Yang!

19:03.720 --> 19:04.840
So...

19:05.720 --> 19:07.160
So it was just a dream.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.560
The brother in my dream

19:11.320 --> 19:13.800
looked just like me.

19:18.100 --> 19:20.440
Why does this sword look different?

19:26.280 --> 19:27.400
Xuejian.

19:27.520 --> 19:28.680
Let me tell you something.

19:28.880 --> 19:30.640
I had a dream last night.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.080
It scared me to death.

19:32.680 --> 19:33.899
Listen to this.

19:33.900 --> 19:35.169
There was a girl in the dream,

19:35.170 --> 19:37.060
floating around in that ruined temple.

19:37.600 --> 19:39.599
She kept calling me pitifully,

19:39.600 --> 19:40.720
"Yang."

19:40.770 --> 19:41.840
"Yang."

19:41.940 --> 19:43.370
Just like a ghost.

19:44.250 --> 19:46.359
Luckily it was only a dream.

19:46.360 --> 19:47.480
You...

19:48.280 --> 19:49.039
You...

19:49.040 --> 19:50.639
Are you talking about her?

19:50.640 --> 19:51.680
Who?

19:54.320 --> 19:55.600
Impossible.

19:55.640 --> 19:57.400
There are no ghosts in this world.

20:01.240 --> 20:02.320
Xuejian!

20:04.400 --> 20:07.720
(Lan Kui)

20:11.030 --> 20:12.309
Unite sword and qi,

20:12.310 --> 20:13.790
ride the sword and soar.

20:14.030 --> 20:14.950
Rise!

20:16.470 --> 20:17.710
It worked!

20:18.710 --> 20:19.870
Jing Tian!

20:41.070 --> 20:44.349
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

20:44.350 --> 20:47.669
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

20:47.670 --> 20:51.349
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

20:51.350 --> 20:54.549
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

20:54.550 --> 20:57.709
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

20:57.710 --> 21:01.389
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

21:01.390 --> 21:05.109
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

21:05.110 --> 21:11.589
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

21:11.590 --> 21:15.069
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

21:15.070 --> 21:18.549
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

21:18.550 --> 21:21.949
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

21:21.950 --> 21:25.349
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

21:25.350 --> 21:28.709
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

21:28.710 --> 21:32.229
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

21:32.230 --> 21:35.589
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

21:35.590 --> 21:38.909
♪All for the sake of the living♪

21:38.910 --> 21:43.710
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

21:58.320 --> 21:59.499
(Next episode preview)

21:59.500 --> 22:00.850
Get on.

22:16.800 --> 22:19.070
You again.

22:19.900 --> 22:21.090
Luo Rulie.
